  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The standard quality control step for neuroimaging pipelines — run MRIQC before fMRIPrep to catch bad scans before preprocessing wastes compute. BIDS-compliant, Docker-containerised, NIH-funded, Apache-2.0. 363 stars, actively maintained by the NiPreps Community. Published in PLOS ONE 2017. Adopt as the first step in any structural or functional MRI research pipeline.",
